WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.500 --> 01:46.960
=Episode 18=

01:47.870 --> 01:49.310
I bet you've upset Her Lordship again.

01:49.910 --> 01:50.990
Go apologize to her.

01:52.080 --> 01:57.120
Shuo Xuan, ever since I met you
in the Jincui Oasis,

01:57.120 --> 01:58.710
you've been treating me badly.

01:59.430 --> 02:01.040
Do I owe you money

02:01.040 --> 02:02.830
or have I done something to you?

02:06.590 --> 02:07.670
You took away my mother.

02:11.039 --> 02:12.510
You are Zhu Yu's daughter too?

02:16.390 --> 02:19.680
My mother was Ling Ye,
the former queen of our clan.

02:21.640 --> 02:23.280
The body that Zhu Yu is using now

02:24.680 --> 02:26.120
is my mother's.

02:31.680 --> 02:35.550
Hundreds of years ago, the Yu Clan
resided at the bottom of the North Sea.

02:36.800 --> 02:38.840
Our Queen Ling Ye,

02:38.840 --> 02:39.960
my mother,

02:40.480 --> 02:43.320
found a nice and warm habitat
at the North Sea

02:44.160 --> 02:47.070
and migrated the entire clan there.

02:48.079 --> 02:51.960
Hundreds of years later,
the Sea of Clear Skies prospered

02:51.960 --> 02:53.680
and became the Pearl of the North Sea.

02:55.590 --> 02:58.870
And then? How did Ling Ye pass away?

02:58.870 --> 03:01.590
How did Zhu Yu become
the Lord of the Yu Clan?

03:02.510 --> 03:03.790
Nobody knew

03:04.960 --> 03:08.000
the Sea of Clear Skies
was built on the back of Kun.

03:10.680 --> 03:13.000
Kun was born from the sea.

03:13.000 --> 03:16.320
It sleeps for hundreds of centuries
to gather strength,

03:17.190 --> 03:20.360
waiting to jump out
of the sea and ascend.

03:32.040 --> 03:33.070
You're right.

03:34.550 --> 03:36.720
On the day of its ascension,

03:37.910 --> 03:39.910
the Sea of Clear Skies on its back

03:40.590 --> 03:42.110
almost collapsed into ruins.

03:49.680 --> 03:53.280
My mother Ling Ye drained her power

03:54.160 --> 03:57.360
to reach Kun's awareness
via the Meditation Spell

03:58.280 --> 03:59.670
and stopped the ascension.

04:01.280 --> 04:04.000
So Kun was Zhu Yu?

04:07.720 --> 04:09.190
Her Lordship stopped ascending.

04:10.280 --> 04:11.880
She took over Ling Ye's body

04:12.520 --> 04:14.110
and started saving the Yu Clan.

04:15.520 --> 04:18.240
She housed all the survivors here

04:18.800 --> 04:20.829
and treated them with her life power.

04:22.079 --> 04:27.310
Years later, those who were
less injured or had greater energy

04:27.910 --> 04:29.280
could finally move around.

04:31.550 --> 04:35.110
All the survivors of the Yu Clan you see

04:36.159 --> 04:38.600
are cured by Her Lordship
with her life power.

04:39.280 --> 04:42.390
She was drained and about to die.

04:42.390 --> 04:43.550
But thanks to Qiyuan...

04:52.640 --> 04:54.440
Since you're back to Her Lordship now

04:55.190 --> 04:56.600
and become the young lord,

04:57.750 --> 05:00.300
you should appreciate
her sacrifice for the clan.

05:00.910 --> 05:02.310
She ended up like this

05:04.390 --> 05:05.450
because of us.

05:15.310 --> 05:17.390
Zhu Yu.

05:22.600 --> 05:25.880
I thought you were gone.

05:26.830 --> 05:30.360
Zhu Yu, Shuo Xuan told me
what happened back then.

05:31.240 --> 05:32.880
I didn't know you had suffered.

05:36.030 --> 05:38.190
So will you stay
at the Sea of Clear Skies?

05:42.800 --> 05:46.550
I'm willing to offer you anything
as long as you stay.

05:52.550 --> 05:54.159
You're still mad at me as I lied to you?

05:55.640 --> 05:58.240
No, it doesn't matter anymore.

06:00.390 --> 06:04.320
Zhu Yu, Shuo Xuan would make
a better young lord than me.

06:05.390 --> 06:08.830
There's nothing I can do here right now.

06:09.670 --> 06:12.440
I don't feel the responsibilities
she mentioned.

06:13.720 --> 06:16.350
I want to go out there
and gain strength.

06:17.600 --> 06:20.230
Only then can I be helpful
to you one day.

06:33.600 --> 06:36.390
My daughter is a big girl now.

06:39.600 --> 06:45.040
I often recall the days
when I was carrying you.

06:45.950 --> 06:47.320
I was amazed.

06:48.320 --> 06:49.670
You were such a tiny creature.

06:50.200 --> 06:53.950
Yet your heart pounded louder
than anything in the world.

06:59.480 --> 07:04.720
I said you were free

07:06.990 --> 07:08.080
to stay or leave.

07:14.950 --> 07:16.830
The Sea of Clear Skies moves.

07:19.000 --> 07:22.920
Take it with you
and you'll sense my location.

07:27.920 --> 07:29.200
Next time I come back,

07:29.830 --> 07:31.830
I'll bring you
my favorite Ji's pastries.

07:35.000 --> 07:36.010
Go.

08:13.510 --> 08:14.540
Mr. Gu.

08:16.920 --> 08:17.930
You're finally here.

08:19.110 --> 08:21.510
It looks like someone has told you

08:21.510 --> 08:22.600
I'd come by today.

08:24.630 --> 08:27.830
Miss Ming wouldn't eat or come out.

08:28.390 --> 08:30.040
Is she fine in there?

08:31.040 --> 08:34.440
There is a reason. Xiu hates to
meet people on her birthday.

08:35.039 --> 08:37.480
I apologize on her behalf.

08:38.720 --> 08:39.760
Please don't say that.

08:40.760 --> 08:42.919
Mr. Ju, do you own this property?

08:44.230 --> 08:47.390
Well... I guess.

08:51.760 --> 08:52.880
Senior, what...

09:05.920 --> 09:08.920
He lost it without any sign.

09:09.600 --> 09:12.920
Like "master", like "disciple".

09:13.720 --> 09:14.880
Master.

09:14.880 --> 09:16.280
I rarely come to Jing'an.

09:16.280 --> 09:18.790
I heard that the river view
in the city is amazing,

09:18.790 --> 09:20.200
especially at night.

09:20.200 --> 09:21.950
Xiu, come with me for a walk.

09:24.630 --> 09:26.860
Join us at the port for fine wine.

09:33.760 --> 09:35.510
I'll go get Jinzhao.

09:43.950 --> 09:45.280
Here. Come on.

09:45.920 --> 09:48.390
Welcome. Pick whatever you like.

09:49.160 --> 09:51.720
Look, the lanterns are also
local specialty.

09:52.280 --> 09:54.600
Look around. Pick anything you like.

09:58.040 --> 09:59.110
This one? Alright.

10:01.830 --> 10:04.790
It's a pretty lantern.
Thank you, Shifang.

10:04.790 --> 10:05.800
Don't mention it.

10:07.510 --> 10:09.600
And for Mr. Gu. Here.

10:10.600 --> 10:12.920
Get him the same one as yours.
What do you say?

10:14.160 --> 10:18.680
Thank you. Such a delicate lantern
brings out the deepest nostalgia.

10:29.510 --> 10:30.670
Jinzhao, check this out.

10:31.280 --> 10:32.280
If Little Yue was here,

10:32.280 --> 10:33.360
- See you at the port.
- she'd love it.

10:39.990 --> 10:41.160
Look. So lively.

10:42.070 --> 10:43.150
Yeah.

10:53.390 --> 10:54.410
Over there.

10:57.720 --> 10:58.730
Xiu is here.

11:08.040 --> 11:09.560
Please get to the shore.

11:09.560 --> 11:10.600
Alright.

11:28.480 --> 11:29.550
How many are there left?

11:31.430 --> 11:32.460
- Five.
- Qi.

11:33.000 --> 11:34.090
You are...?

11:34.630 --> 11:36.800
I'm sorry.

12:10.800 --> 12:15.240
Zhaoyan, why is your lantern
different from Xiu's?

12:20.510 --> 12:22.240
It was a random pick.

12:23.390 --> 12:24.830
You picked a wolf?

12:24.830 --> 12:26.800
A wolf? It's obviously a dog.

12:33.510 --> 12:34.600
The meat smells great.

12:35.870 --> 12:36.940
It looks like a wolf to me.

13:29.200 --> 13:31.920
♪Looking back♪

13:31.920 --> 13:35.950
♪I try to bring back memories♪

13:35.950 --> 13:40.490
♪We're connected♪

13:40.490 --> 13:43.340
♪It's meant to be♪

13:46.310 --> 13:47.340
Qi.

13:48.590 --> 13:52.080
♪Years leave no trace behind♪

13:52.080 --> 13:54.410
♪On a moonlight night♪

13:54.410 --> 13:56.590
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

13:56.590 --> 13:59.180
♪About you♪

13:59.180 --> 14:02.700
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

14:03.370 --> 14:06.800
♪It's unforgettable. It's all about you♪

14:07.340 --> 14:09.000
♪The past glided before my mind♪

14:09.000 --> 14:11.400
♪I smiled and cried♪

14:11.400 --> 14:15.790
♪For happiness♪

14:16.620 --> 14:20.590
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

14:20.590 --> 14:24.650
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

14:24.650 --> 14:26.600
♪In this tranquil world♪

14:26.600 --> 14:28.560
♪I've finally found you♪

14:28.560 --> 14:32.520
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

14:32.520 --> 14:34.510
♪I've been looking for you♪

14:35.280 --> 14:38.480
Jinzhao, our feelings are not fake.

14:39.830 --> 14:41.720
There's no such thing as Husheng Spell.

14:42.720 --> 14:43.760
I know.

14:45.360 --> 14:51.470
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

15:15.430 --> 15:17.240
Ming Xiu, happy birthday!

15:17.240 --> 15:19.120
Thank you. Welcome back.

15:20.990 --> 15:23.560
Everyone's here. Xiu will have

15:23.560 --> 15:24.920
a perfect birthday.

15:24.920 --> 15:26.870
Yeah. Time is pressing.

15:27.390 --> 15:29.510
I made a gadget for Miss Ming.

15:30.040 --> 15:33.160
It transfers small items. Here.

15:34.310 --> 15:35.720
Miss Ming, do you like it?

15:39.720 --> 15:40.780
Thank you, Shifang.

15:42.310 --> 15:45.190
Miss Ming, I saw this
at the accessory shop.

15:45.190 --> 15:46.280
I hope you like it.

15:50.870 --> 15:51.950
Thank you, Zhaoyan.

15:59.240 --> 16:01.560
How do you know it wasn't Hanjiang?

16:02.120 --> 16:03.240
It was me, though.

16:04.070 --> 16:05.990
Only you would make a fuss about it.

16:08.280 --> 16:11.120
It's not an important day.

16:12.310 --> 16:13.360
I find it important.

16:19.990 --> 16:23.560
Ming Xiu, birthday matters.
But I didn't...

16:23.560 --> 16:24.630
Didn't what?

16:24.630 --> 16:27.660
- Here. It's from both of us.
- Thank you.

16:27.660 --> 16:29.130
- Thank you.
- When did you get it?

16:29.130 --> 16:30.830
How do you know I'd be back?

16:30.830 --> 16:31.850
I just do.

16:32.720 --> 16:35.360
Miss Ming, I heard
in the Western Regions,

16:35.360 --> 16:37.720
if someone makes a birthday wish,

16:37.720 --> 16:39.560
Heaven will make it come true.

16:41.430 --> 16:44.070
Really? Miss Ming, come on. Make a wish.

16:48.920 --> 16:51.430
My master knows my wishes.

16:58.070 --> 16:59.280
I've aged.

16:59.280 --> 17:03.120
I only hope that someone can
fulfill your wish soon.

17:05.190 --> 17:08.359
Some wishes
can't be fulfilled by random people.

17:13.359 --> 17:14.630
Little Yue, what do you wish for?

17:15.630 --> 17:18.119
Endless delicacies, I guess.

17:20.480 --> 17:22.630
I wish I could live happily

17:22.630 --> 17:24.240
and peacefully with Jinzhao forever.

17:25.750 --> 17:27.240
So I matter more than food.

17:28.119 --> 17:32.040
Of course. You'll get me delicacies
when we're together, anyway.

17:32.040 --> 17:34.250
It's killing two birds with one stone.

17:34.870 --> 17:35.920
Thank you.

17:36.480 --> 17:38.190
We know what Jinzhao wants.

17:39.750 --> 17:40.780
And you, Luo?

17:43.240 --> 17:44.830
It's still the same.

17:44.830 --> 17:47.600
I want the people
to remember the Luo family

17:47.600 --> 17:48.680
and me.

17:49.560 --> 17:51.480
Master Luo is truly ambitious.

17:52.070 --> 17:54.430
Xian Qing, what do you wish for?

17:56.120 --> 17:58.680
I have no obsession, hence, no wishes.

17:59.560 --> 18:01.870
Xian Qing, don't be so resolute.

18:02.390 --> 18:04.750
Hanjiang, let go of your obsession.

18:10.600 --> 18:11.630
What about you, Shifang?

18:12.830 --> 18:15.190
M-My wish is to

18:16.430 --> 18:18.950
become a great gadget technician
like my mother

18:22.600 --> 18:24.720
and to gather for birthdays

18:24.720 --> 18:26.830
like we're doing right now.

18:28.560 --> 18:29.610
We will.

18:31.120 --> 18:33.510
So we can make two wishes.
I lost my chance.

18:36.360 --> 18:38.070
Come on, cheers.

18:38.070 --> 18:39.990
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

18:39.990 --> 18:41.750
Ming Xiu, happy birthday!

18:41.750 --> 18:43.280
- Happy birthday!
- Thank you.

18:45.870 --> 18:47.920
Jinzhao, look. River lanterns.

18:49.710 --> 18:50.890
Come with me.

18:50.890 --> 18:51.980
Alright.

19:05.110 --> 19:08.750
Flow far far away, my little lantern.

19:10.200 --> 19:11.280
Qi.

19:13.280 --> 19:15.660
Let's stay together forever, okay?

19:17.100 --> 19:19.880
♪That determined look on your face♪

19:21.470 --> 19:24.200
Deal. Pinky promise.

19:25.780 --> 19:29.610
♪Light and shadow freeze at the moment♪

19:30.280 --> 19:32.940
♪I look for you here and there♪

19:32.940 --> 19:36.620
♪Following the strong heartbeat♪

19:36.620 --> 19:41.800
♪Holding your hands, I breathe rapidly♪

19:44.800 --> 19:48.280
Do you remember
what I asked you in the mine?

19:49.290 --> 19:53.160
♪One hug is enough for an answer♪

19:53.160 --> 19:55.710
Qi, who am I

19:57.840 --> 19:58.860
to you?

20:02.000 --> 20:04.330
♪Why do I only want you♪

20:04.840 --> 20:05.900
What is your answer?

20:09.710 --> 20:13.200
♪It's all worth it
as long as you're around♪

20:14.510 --> 20:15.800
Not an older brother, anyway.

20:19.080 --> 20:23.690
♪I'm sure I only want you♪

20:31.340 --> 20:35.280
♪A smile of yours melts all my sorrow♪

20:35.850 --> 20:39.500
♪It's all worth it
as long as you're around♪

20:39.500 --> 20:44.590
♪I won't listen to any rumor♪

20:45.230 --> 20:50.120
♪I'm sure I only want you♪

20:52.750 --> 20:58.960
Shuo Xuan, I don't eat fish anymore.

21:00.560 --> 21:02.870
Mr. Ju can't drink at all.

21:07.590 --> 21:10.590
Master, your eyes...

21:18.920 --> 21:22.200
It's fine. Maybe I drank too much.

21:24.470 --> 21:26.160
I just remembered.

21:26.160 --> 21:29.390
You used to imitate Xian Qing and me
drinking when you were a kid.

21:30.040 --> 21:31.710
But you fell asleep after a few sips,

21:32.630 --> 21:34.560
and I had to carry you to your room.

21:35.470 --> 21:38.200
Time flies and you're a big girl now.

21:40.870 --> 21:42.510
Master, has it ever

21:44.200 --> 21:46.320
crossed your mind that I was only...

21:52.560 --> 21:55.230
You drank a lot. Take a nap.

22:04.080 --> 22:08.350
Will you run away when I'm asleep?

22:09.560 --> 22:10.570
Run away?

22:13.870 --> 22:15.040
I'm not leaving.

22:46.870 --> 22:51.200
Xiu, I am really worried about you.

22:53.040 --> 23:00.040
Mother, is it true
that I'm not gifted as a technician?

23:01.110 --> 23:03.200
I want to be like you

23:04.470 --> 23:08.350
and make fabulous gadgets like Dou Bao.

23:10.160 --> 23:16.510
Also, I swear I will protect Dou Bao.

23:18.440 --> 23:22.960
That's the only thing you left me.

23:50.700 --> 23:54.510
The view is truly breathtaking.

23:56.560 --> 23:59.050
You're heading to the Zhengwu Alliance.

23:59.830 --> 24:00.990
I won't go with you.

24:03.550 --> 24:04.620
Take care.

24:06.950 --> 24:11.500
Be very careful when you try
to take their headquarters.

24:12.830 --> 24:13.900
Alright.

24:18.670 --> 24:19.690
Xian Qing.

24:23.070 --> 24:24.590
Where are you going?

24:28.430 --> 24:30.670
Why? Are you reluctant to leave me?

24:35.670 --> 24:38.310
Next time we meet, we'll enjoy

24:39.310 --> 24:41.910
the river view during the day.
What do you say?

24:47.110 --> 24:48.110
I'd love to.

24:50.670 --> 24:51.760
It's a deal.

24:56.270 --> 24:57.290
Deal.

25:22.030 --> 25:24.590
(Zhengwu Alliance)
Guanren, the trigrams show

25:25.190 --> 25:26.710
the alliance will be in grave danger.

25:27.430 --> 25:29.150
I'm worried that it's about

25:29.150 --> 25:31.070
your attack on the Qiyuan Sect.

25:32.350 --> 25:35.710
I finally found out
where their headquarters is.

25:35.710 --> 25:36.970
It's a rare chance.

25:37.510 --> 25:42.030
It will be hard to take them down
if we miss this chance.

25:42.790 --> 25:46.440
Hanjiang, you're a great man,
wise and brave.

25:46.990 --> 25:49.790
But you are slightly obsessed
with fortune-telling.

25:51.270 --> 25:55.950
Fine. But I'll come with you.

25:56.550 --> 25:58.430
That would be great.

26:01.190 --> 26:03.150
Mr. Zuo, Mr. Gu.

26:04.350 --> 26:05.910
Here's the map Meng Cheng provided.

26:06.910 --> 26:08.790
It shows the headquarters
of the Qiyuan Sect.

26:08.790 --> 26:10.270
They have a front and a rear gate.

26:14.110 --> 26:18.270
Judging from the terrace,
we will break in from the front.

26:19.390 --> 26:21.190
As for the rear gate...

26:21.190 --> 26:22.280
We got this.

26:23.110 --> 26:26.070
Alright, you are highly skilled.

26:26.750 --> 26:29.870
They won't be able
to handle our attack on both fronts.

26:30.510 --> 26:33.870
It would be great if we could

26:34.470 --> 26:35.710
wipe them out at once.

26:36.390 --> 26:38.190
Time is pressing. I'll inform everyone.

26:38.790 --> 26:39.790
Alright.

26:46.350 --> 26:47.400
Master.

26:53.350 --> 26:58.310
Master, why didn't you come back
with Xian Qing yesterday?

27:00.510 --> 27:03.590
And what happened to your eyes?

27:09.030 --> 27:10.150
You have so many questions.

27:10.910 --> 27:13.190
Which one should I answer first?

27:15.590 --> 27:19.230
I had a glimpse of the future
at Pureness some days ago.

27:19.790 --> 27:22.910
I took a few glances and hurt my eyes.

27:26.630 --> 27:31.110
Are you joining them on the attack
because of what you saw?

27:32.070 --> 27:35.470
Xiu, I will go with Mr. Zuo.

27:35.990 --> 27:38.310
You will go with Mr. Yue.

27:39.430 --> 27:40.520
Be careful.

27:44.230 --> 27:47.950
Aren't you going to protect me?

27:50.750 --> 27:51.910
You're a big girl now.

27:53.630 --> 27:54.710
You don't need my protection.

28:09.630 --> 28:14.110
Master, I've never let you down.

28:17.110 --> 28:19.030
But you don't mind letting me down.

28:39.430 --> 28:43.190
(I saw a huge casualty
of the Zhengwu Alliance at Pureness.)

28:43.870 --> 28:45.350
(But I don't know whether)

28:46.190 --> 28:48.270
(it will happen during this attack.)

29:01.110 --> 29:04.430
(It's less worrying to have Xian Qing
protect Xiu in the dark.)

29:05.230 --> 29:07.910
(Other than that, I have to)

29:08.830 --> 29:12.030
(change what I've seen
even if it costs me my life.)

29:29.390 --> 29:32.590
Over the past two decades, our alliance

29:33.430 --> 29:35.870
has annihilated

29:36.510 --> 29:38.190
countless evil creatures

29:38.910 --> 29:41.030
to guard our nation.

29:42.030 --> 29:44.710
(Ningzheng Hall)
Right now, the nation is at risk.

29:45.750 --> 29:48.910
People are tormented by the Qiyuan Sect.

29:50.110 --> 29:53.230
We must bring justice to the world.

29:53.910 --> 29:57.510
- Bring justice to the world.
- Bring justice to the world.

29:57.510 --> 29:59.070
- Bring justice to the world.
- Bring justice to the world.

30:03.750 --> 30:04.790
Yue Jinzhao.

30:08.110 --> 30:09.130
(Ningzheng Hall)
Mr. Zuo.

30:24.710 --> 30:27.670
This blade is the Silver Shadow,

30:29.030 --> 30:31.070
a collection of the Sword Sage
on Shushan Mount.

30:31.830 --> 30:33.350
It was passed on
to the Demon Lord's son.

30:35.910 --> 30:41.030
I will give this blade to you today.

30:41.710 --> 30:45.480
♪The world is everchanging♪

30:46.830 --> 30:50.070
All the divine and demonic
weapons were known

30:50.070 --> 30:52.470
because of
what the weapon owners had done.

30:54.610 --> 30:56.330
♪The vicissitudes of life♪

30:56.330 --> 30:59.370
♪The world is in turbulence. So what♪

30:59.370 --> 31:04.840
♪You're fighting the world alongside me♪

31:05.750 --> 31:06.870
Mr. Zuo, thank you

31:07.950 --> 31:09.510
for giving me this blade.

31:10.470 --> 31:13.270
I shall carry on
its spirit of righteousness

31:13.950 --> 31:17.190
and make it known in jianghu

31:17.190 --> 31:18.350
as my weapon one day.

31:20.310 --> 31:25.150
Good. Men shouldn't seek fame
from the weapons they hold.

31:25.830 --> 31:28.030
Our weapons should be known
because of us.

31:28.790 --> 31:30.830
Mr. Yue, try it.

31:35.720 --> 31:38.350
♪Nostalgic about your gentle look♪

31:39.180 --> 31:44.180
♪Wander the world with a sword in hand
while all love and hatred♪

31:44.180 --> 31:48.750
♪Fade away through time♪

31:56.910 --> 31:58.280
(Materialize your dream)

32:08.620 --> 32:11.560
(Headquarters of the Qiyuan Sect)

32:13.630 --> 32:14.870
Our great Lord Ming.

32:16.310 --> 32:18.830
All mighty Lord Ming.

32:19.950 --> 32:25.830
I, Gao Xiao, pledge to you
as the sect leader of Qiyuan.

32:25.830 --> 32:29.870
We shall serve you
with the greatest loyalty

32:30.430 --> 32:36.230
and make your glorious glow
shine upon the world.

32:36.910 --> 32:39.390
May Lord Ming bless us.

32:39.950 --> 32:42.870
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

32:44.230 --> 32:47.150
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

32:48.870 --> 32:51.990
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

33:55.500 --> 33:58.280
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

33:59.150 --> 34:02.350
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

34:02.960 --> 34:06.030
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

34:26.870 --> 34:30.230
The map says it's the rear passage
to the headquarters.

34:30.730 --> 34:34.270
Jinzhao, we must destroy the Qiyuan Sect

34:34.270 --> 34:35.310
ruthlessly.

34:38.429 --> 34:41.350
Jinzhao, how come you're always so calm

34:41.350 --> 34:42.989
like you can see the future?

34:45.389 --> 34:46.409
To the left.

34:52.510 --> 34:53.790
Jinzhao, are you alright?

34:55.469 --> 34:56.949
Don't worry. It's always like that.

34:59.390 --> 35:01.910
I can see the future indeed.

35:01.910 --> 35:04.710
So pull yourself together.

35:05.230 --> 35:07.070
I'm here so we won't lose.

35:11.350 --> 35:14.110
Mr. Yue, Mr. Ju, let's enter.

35:23.150 --> 35:24.350
My master came along this time

35:25.190 --> 35:27.470
and I have the feeling
that he's hiding something.

35:29.910 --> 35:30.950
Don't worry, Miss Ming.

35:31.550 --> 35:33.550
There are so many alliance disciples.

35:33.550 --> 35:34.990
And Mr. Gu is a great fighter.

35:34.990 --> 35:36.190
Nobody will be in danger.

35:37.550 --> 35:38.600
Let's go.

36:06.950 --> 36:08.430
Why so hesitant? Hurry up.

36:09.030 --> 36:10.110
Qianjun, no rush.

36:10.950 --> 36:14.150
The ground seems dug
on both sides. It's fishy.

36:16.390 --> 36:17.550
Let's talk first.

36:18.110 --> 36:19.630
Mr. Yue, what do you say?

36:19.630 --> 36:20.650
To the left.

36:23.870 --> 36:25.310
Do as he says. To the left.

36:32.070 --> 36:34.000
Xu. Can we count on him?

36:34.510 --> 36:37.350
Of course. Remember
what he did at the Langyin Pavilion...

36:40.950 --> 36:42.030
Step aside.

37:02.900 --> 37:05.810
♪Looking back♪

37:06.930 --> 37:10.130
♪I try to bring back memories♪

37:11.020 --> 37:14.930
♪We're connected♪

37:14.930 --> 37:17.200
♪It's meant to be♪

37:18.800 --> 37:22.450
♪I've fallen in love silently♪

37:22.960 --> 37:26.770
♪Years leave no trace behind♪

37:26.770 --> 37:29.010
♪On a moonlight night♪

37:29.010 --> 37:30.990
♪I lapsed into my memories♪

37:30.990 --> 37:33.710
♪About you♪

37:33.710 --> 37:37.010
♪All laughter and joy are about you♪

37:37.710 --> 37:41.100
♪It's unforgettable. It's all about you♪

37:41.650 --> 37:43.500
♪The past glided before my mind♪

37:43.500 --> 37:45.740
♪I smiled and cried♪

37:45.740 --> 37:51.000
♪For happiness♪

37:51.000 --> 37:54.900
♪I went about the world looking for you♪

37:54.900 --> 37:58.990
♪All I have was the echo in the valley♪

37:58.990 --> 38:00.940
♪In this tranquil world♪

38:00.940 --> 38:02.990
♪I've finally found you♪

38:02.990 --> 38:07.020
♪I'll spend the rest
of my life with you♪

38:07.020 --> 38:10.770
♪I've been looking for you♪

38:10.770 --> 38:14.900
♪I wish to share joy
and sorrow with you♪

38:15.730 --> 38:17.170
♪Among the vast sea of people♪

38:17.170 --> 38:19.440
♪I engrave your name♪

38:19.440 --> 38:25.460
♪Believe me, you're the only one♪

